      },
      "message": "feat: expose per-player handicap percentage from replay headers\n\nThe handicap bytes (8 per player, save version >= 25.06) were being\nread and discarded. Now the second Int32 (handicap %) is decoded and\npropagated through the fast parser, model layer, and Player dataclass.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
